"Index Catalogue of Nebulae and Clusters of Stars (abbreviated as IC) serves "
"as a supplement to the NGC, and contains an additional 5,386 objects, "
"collectively known as the IC objects."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:256
#, no-c-format
