"Messier Catalogue is a catalogue of 110 deep-sky objects, including diffuse "
"nebulae, planetary nebulae, open clusters, globular clusters and galaxies. "
"Messier objects have names like M1, M2, up to M110. The maximum apparent "
"visual magnitude of Messier Catalogue is represented by M91's value of 10.2."
msgstr ""

