#. Tag: para
#: config.docbook:435
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Below the stars section, the <guilabel>Deep-Sky Objects</guilabel> section "
"controls the display of several non-stellar object catalogs. You can toggle "
"the display of Deep Sky Objects and control the display of their names and "
"magnitudes. By default, the list of deep-sky objects includes the Messier, "
"NGC and IC catalogs. Addons catalogs are available via the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Data</guimenu><guimenuitem>Download New Data...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> submenu where you can download catalogs provided "
"by &kstars; team and the community. Furthermore, &kstars; supports import of "
"custom catalogs. To import a raw ASCII catalog data file into &kstars;, "
"press the <guibutton>Import Catalog</guibutton> and follow the instructions. "
"To import a custom catalog already in &kstars; catalog format, press the "
"<guilabel>Load Catalog</guilabel> button. Each line in the custom catalog "
"file should contain the following space-separated fields:"
